    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Description :</b>  When a customer has an existing due amount and return a paid product, the return product’s price should be deducted from the customer’s <b>Total Due.</b> However, After Processing the return, The System doesn't reduce the total due by the returned product’s price.</p>

<p><b>Step To Reproduce:</b><br/>
1. Select the Customer parties with an existing due.<br/>
2. select the paid products .<br/>
3.Then return the paid products .<br/>
4.Complete the return product.<br/>
5. Check the total due.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result :</b> After returning the paid product, the product price should be deducted from the Total Due.</p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b><br/>
The system does not deduct the returned product's price from the Total Due.</p>

